y, mainly reflecting basic information, which might detract from the conversation's professionalism and informative value.\n   [RESULT] A\n\n5. Evidence-Based Support:\n   - Response A aligns well with medical details and recommendations recorded in the notes. The doctor's observations and treatment decisions are based directly on the notes, ensuring credibility.\n   - Response B provides basis for medical decisions regarding tests and medication, but lacks the detailed support and rationale presented explicitly in the assessment and plan.\n   [RESULT] A\n   \nOverall, based strictly on the score rubric, Response A performs better across all evaluation criteria and should be considered the preferred option.\n[RESULT] A", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null}}], "created": 1732910517, "model": "gpt-4o-2024-08-06", "object": "chat.completion", "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": "fp_7f6be3efb0", "usage": {"completion_tokens": 457, "prompt_tokens": 4176, "total_tokens": 4633, "completion_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "reasoning_tokens": 0, "accepted_prediction_tokens": 0, "rejected_prediction_tokens": 0}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0}}}


